      "question": ""
    }
  },"decision":{
    "summary":"The investigation board contains two unsupported claims (nodes node-196v4e3 and node-hddaa6) that require clarification. Node-node-17qb23w is supported as the directory explicitly states it does not establish valve positions or pressure availability.",
    "evidenceUsed":["b678a928-a8d2-472d-bc03-2e1a3dc411e6#1","7e69d300-c57e-40a8-bb37-35a61073ff33#1"],"unknowns":["Exact timing of acceptance requirement vs notification timestamp.","Definition and existence status of required temporary instruction for this specific boundary change."],"alternatives":["The 'pending' state might be procedural rather than a failure if the process allows preparation before formal release.", "A blank attachment field could mean no document was generated yet, not necessarily ignored or missing per procedure."],
